 "body_html": "<h2>怎麼想</h2><p>整數相除的結果可以用分數表示：<b>a ÷ b ＝ <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>a</span><span class='fd'>b</span></span></b>，被除數當分子，除數當分母。</p><p>平分：3 個披薩平分給 4 人，每人 3 ÷ 4 ＝ <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>3</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span> 個。</p><p>求幾倍：5 是 8 的 5 ÷ 8 ＝ <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>5</span><span class='fd'>8</span></span> 倍。答案是假分數時，可以化成帶分數，能約分要約分。</p><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>例題</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>7 ÷ 3 ＝（用分數表示）</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>被除數 7 當分子，除數 3 當分母：<span class='fr'><span class='fn'>7</span><span class='fd'>3</span></span>。</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>答：2<span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>3</span></span></p></div><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>例題</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>5 公升果汁平分到 8 杯，每杯幾公升？</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>5 ÷ 8 ＝ <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>5</span><span class='fd'>8</span></span>。</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>答：<span class='fr'><span class='fn'>5</span><span class='fd'>8</span></span> 公升</p></div><h2>常見錯誤</h2><div class='sn-tw'><table class='sn-table'><thead><tr><th>常見錯誤</th><th>正確的想法</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3 ÷ 4 ＝ <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>4</span><span class='fd'>3</span></span></td><td>被除數是分子：<span class='fr'><span class='fn'>3</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>7 ÷ 3 只寫 2（忘了餘下的）</td><td>寫成分數：2<span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>3</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>答案 <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>6</span><span class='fd'>8</span></span> 沒有約分</td><td>約成 <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>3</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
